audiveris-native — score image to MusicXML, following the Audiveris pipeline.

The recognition algorithms, constants, head templates (via the Bravura font),
glyph features and the trained glyph classifier model follow Audiveris 5.11.0
(https://github.com/Audiveris/audiveris, commit 9e1e55cd2746037d059345881c53e6a6754bffbd),
